      "writtenOn": "2021-03-21T22:26:15Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This logic will not be needed for all SoCs but only for SoCs with integrated Mux.\n@prashant, “AP misses the disconnection” is not accurate statement. In fact EC is unable to send the disconnect event.",
      "parentUuid": "bdd6ba1a_4bcf0eec",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 359,
